    eyebrow: "A typical partner journey",
    title: "Meet Leah. She needs to turn a commitment into support people can actually use.",
    intro: "Leah represents corporate social value, customer, workforce and community leaders who need a credible delivery route without building another programme from scratch.",
    personName: "Leah, social impact lead",
    personContext: "Responsible for a priority such as financial resilience, employability, caring, health equity or community wellbeing.",
    personImage: "/images/landing/corporate-leah.webp",
    personAlt: "Illustrated portrait representing Leah, a corporate social impact lead",
    beforeTitle: "Leah has ambition but no connected delivery model",
    beforeItems: [
      "Internal needs and community investment are managed through separate programmes.",
