---

<AudienceLanding {...page}>
  <section slot="before-challenge" class="section corporate-route-chooser" aria-labelledby="corporate-route-title">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading audience-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow dark">Choose your starting point</p><h2 id="corporate-route-title">What do you want to achieve first?</h2></div>
        <p>Select a route to see the relevant offer. Only one is shown at a time, so you can focus on the conversation that matters now.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="corporate-route-grid" role="tablist" aria-label="Corporate partnership routes">
        <button class="corporate-route-card route-cohort is-active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="route-panel-cohort" id="route-tab-cohort" data-route-tab="cohort">
          <span>Route 01: Fund shared impact</span><h3>Mission Cohort Partnership</h3>
          <p>Choose one mission, equip a group of trusted social enterprises and receive one clear account of collective impact.</p>
          <strong>Show this route <b aria-hidden="true">→</b></strong>
        </button>
        <button class="corporate-route-card route-direct" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="route-panel-direct" id="route-tab-direct" data-route-tab="direct">
          <span>Route 02: Support your own people</span><h3>AI Coaching Partnership</h3>
          <p>Give your employees, customers or communities trusted guidance through a coach built around your organisation.</p>
          <strong>Show this route <b aria-hidden="true">→</b></strong>
        </button>
      </div>
      <figure class="corporate-route-visual">
        <img src="/images/landing/corporate-two-routes.webp" alt="Social enterprises and corporate teams connected through AI coaching and one view of impact" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>
          <span><b>01</b> Choose one audience or mission</span>
          <span><b>02</b> Train coaches in trusted expertise</span>
          <span><b>03</b> Support people and measure value</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section slot="after-solution" class="section corporate-choice-panel mission-cohort-offer" id="route-panel-cohort" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="route-tab-cohort" data-route-panel="cohort">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading audience-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Route 01: Mission Cohort Partnership</p><h2>Fund one mission. Equip trusted organisations. See the impact clearly.</h2></div>
        <p>You choose a population, place, contract outcome or mission. Bridgit and SEUK shape a small group of relevant social enterprises around it. Each member keeps ownership of its expertise and local delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-cohort-grid">
        <ol class="mission-cohort-steps">
          <li><span>01</span><div><h3>Choose the mission</h3><p>Start with care, health equity, secure homes, financial resilience, jobs and skills or another defined outcome.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>02</span><div><h3>Design the group</h3><p>Identify two to five social enterprises, the shared journey, local configuration, safeguards and realistic budget.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>03</span><div><h3>Deploy local coaches</h3><p>Each member receives configured AI coaching, onboarding, training and continued improvement around its service.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>04</span><div><h3>Report one impact story</h3><p>A shared evidence approach brings the results together without hiding local differences.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
        <aside class="sponsor-report-card">
          <span>What you receive</span><h3>One clear sponsor report with useful evidence underneath.</h3>
          <ul><li><strong>Reach</strong><small>Who accessed support and whether priority groups were reached</small></li><li><strong>Engagement</strong><small>Plans, repeat use, actions and resources accessed</small></li><li><strong>Service movement</strong><small>Referrals, handovers and meaningful journey milestones</small></li><li><strong>Outcomes</strong><small>Confidence, stability, wellbeing, progression and operational value</small></li><li><strong>Next decision</strong><small>What to repeat, expand, integrate or stop</small></li></ul>
          <a href="#book-a-call">Design a two to five member cohort <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section slot="after-solution" class="section corporate-choice-panel ai-delivery-offer" id="route-panel-direct" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="route-tab-direct" data-route-panel="direct" hidden>
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading audience-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow dark">Route 02: AI Coaching Partnership</p><h2>Give people trusted support at any time, with your team still at the centre.</h2></div>
        <p>Bridgit designs and deploys coaches around one important journey in your organisation. People get clear guidance and practical follow up, while complex situations return to the right human team.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="corporate-usecase-grid corporate-usecase-grid-simple">
        <article><span>Employees</span><h3>Wellbeing, caring, money and progression</h3><p>Confidential guidance and planning that protects manager and specialist capacity.</p></article>
        <article><span>Customers</span><h3>Vulnerability and service navigation</h3><p>Earlier, consistent support with clear handovers into the right human teams.</p></article>
        <article><span>Projects and contracts</span><h3>Jobs, skills and community outcomes</h3><p>Help people move from awareness into actions, appointments and measurable progress.</p></article>
        <article><span>Community networks</span><h3>One approachable place to begin</h3><p>Scale trusted guidance across locations while retaining a clear route to human help.</p></article>
      </div>
      <div class="corporate-direct-steps">
        <p><strong>Choose one journey</strong><span>Focus the first service on a clear audience and need.</span></p>
        <p><strong>Train the coach</strong><span>Use approved knowledge, tone, policies and routes to people.</span></p>
        <p><strong>Launch in familiar channels</strong><span>Use web, voice, WhatsApp or the full Bridgit app.</span></p>
        <p><strong>Learn and improve</strong><span>Track questions, actions, referrals and outcomes.</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</AudienceLanding>

<script is:inline>
  (() => {
    const tabs = [...document.querySelectorAll("[data-route-tab]")];
    const panels = [...document.querySelectorAll("[data-route-panel]")];
    tabs.forEach((tab) => tab.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const route = tab.getAttribute("data-route-tab");
      tabs.forEach((item) => {
        const active = item === tab;
        item.classList.toggle("is-active", active);
        item.setAttribute("aria-selected", String(active));
      });
      panels.forEach((panel) => {
        panel.hidden = panel.getAttribute("data-route-panel") !== route;
      });
      document.querySelector(`[data-route-panel="${route}"]`)?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: "smooth", block: "start" });
    }));
  })();
</script>
